From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nikolajs Agafonovs <nikolajs.agafonovs@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 19:04:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] JavaScript: MutationObserver, IntersectionObserver and
 ResizeObserver

window.__netsurf_native.observeMutations(node, hook) adds capturing
libdom listeners for the mutation events to a node and calls hook for
each insertion, removal, attribute and character data change, with
whether a script is running (duk_netsurf_call_depth in the QuickJS
layer).  webapi.js builds MutationObserver on it (records per observer,
childList/attributes/characterData, subtree, old values,
attributeFilter, takeRecords, disconnect; delivered as a microtask, or
from a 0 ms timer for the parser's insertions; multi-node operations
merged into one record) and IntersectionObserver and ResizeObserver on
the layout boxes (box() now also gives the content box and padding),
checked every 100 ms while something is observed.
